        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_346974603d1744c3a1f0beb3cf3a7b61",
      "statement": "The daemon runs enforceClientVersion before all other handling on every path including /v1/pair: an X-Herdr-Connect-Client-Version header below MinSupportedClientVersion (1) yields 426 client_outdated, while a missing header is allowed through for curl and health probes. Conversely the mobile client checks the daemon's api_version against MIN_SUPPORTED_DAEMON_API_VERSION (1) and enters a terminal daemon_outdated state if too old.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://apps/mobile/src/agent-contract.ts#L31-L35",
