        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_9d972b84a144427a99c5452dfed8b98b",
      "statement": "Devices are revoked host-side via herdr-connect devices revoke (setting revoked_at_ms) or self-revoked by the device via DELETE /v1/device (handleSelfRevoke), where deviceID is derived from the bearer token so a device can only revoke itself; both paths share lanauth.RevokeDevice and subsequent requests with that token receive 401 revoked.",
