      "id": "claim_abeb07c055764026bdd45539753ac18a",
      "statement": "The internal/lanauth package owns all LAN security logic (certificate identity, secret/token lifecycle, revocation) without depending on net/http; HTTP route mapping, status codes, and rate limiting live in internal/demolan.",
